    hsp huq hmass hK (fun a b => ⟨hKI.1 a b,hKI.2 a b⟩)
    (fun i a => ⟨hDI.1 i a,hDI.2 i a⟩) hB hBI δ hδ j
  change exploitability (blockMatrix K D B) (blockWeights p q)=floorIntervalGameValue d s u at he
  rw [he] at hE
